      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does WRYDECO standard shipping include wall mounting or hanging hardware installation?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. Complimentary standard shipping covers delivery of your handcrafted shelf to your address but does not include wall mounting or installation services unless confirmed in writing. Because solid hardwood shelves carry substantial weight, we recommend two-person installation or hiring a licensed local handyman."
      }
    },
