      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can a floating tree shelf be installed on drywall without finding wall studs?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We strongly advise against mounting solid hardwood floating shelves onto unbacked drywall with plastic anchors alone. For safe long-term book and decor display, structural screws must penetrate solid wood framing studs or masonry brick by at least 1.5 to 2 inches."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How long does crafting and delivery take for a living room floating shelf?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Estimated processing and crafting takes approximately 15 to 20 business days, followed by carrier transit taking an estimated 3 to 5 business days, for a total estimated delivery window of 18 to 25 business days."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How do I request a cancellation or change my wood finish after placing an order?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "WRYDECO offers a 6-hour Golden Window immediately after checkout during which you can cancel for a 100% free refund or change size and wood finish by emailing support@wrydeco.com. Once 6 hours elapse, production begins and orders lock."
      }
